# This file enables automatic devenv shell activation via direnv.
#
# Prerequisites:
#   - direnv installed: https://direnv.net
#   - devenv installed: https://devenv.sh
#
# After cloning, run once:
#   direnv allow
#
# From that point on, entering this directory in any terminal automatically
# activates the devenv environment — Go, tools, and git hooks are all available
# without running `devenv shell` manually.
use devenv
